  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Aivancity School for Technology is a private school that focuses on artificial intelligence (AI), data, technology, business, and ethics. It offers higher education diplomas, Bachelor of Science, and Master of Science degrees, along with summer school and training programs.</p><p>Aivancity is the first and only AI and Data school awarding an accredited diploma, recognised by the Ministry of Higher Education, Research, and Innovation. It aims to become the benchmark school for AI in France and Europe and to expand internationally.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Aivancity provides you with various student support services, including career counselling, mentorship programs, and academic guidance. Aivancity also offers language support and integration programs to help with your educational journey.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Aivancity offers student residences at the CROUS campus of Cachan, and other places close to the campus. These include private and shared accommodation options.</p><p>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\">download our app</a> and check out the Stays feature!</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
